( FLOATING POINT )

: ASCF 0 CIX ! INBUF ! AFP F> ;

: FLIT R> DUP 6 + >R F@ ;
: FLITERAL STATE @ IF
  COMPILE FLIT HERE F! 6 ALLOT
  ENDIF ;
: FLOATING  ( FLOAT FOLLOWING CONSTANT )
   BL WORD HERE 1+ ASCF
   FLITERAL ;  IMMEDIATE
( EX:  FLOATING 1.2345 )
( OR   FLOATING  -1.67E-13 )

: FP [COMPILE] FLOATING ;
IMMEDIATE     -->
